  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Justice for All:Tackling Nukes and Climate Change</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Commemorating the 40th Anniversary of the June 12, 1982 Rally for Nuclear Disarmament, our documentary intends to draw attention to the multi-varied perspectives of activists who were present at the historic event by specifically highlighting the work and memories of activists of color. In doing so, we intend to reveal the intertwined relationship between the struggles for environmental justice, social justice, and human rights.</narrative>
  </description>
